  {
   "id": "DvVfWZrpRcjzSdM6Qug0_",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 955,
   "width": 1137.29833984375,
   "height": 45.900000000000006,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "ae",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 547719855,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 1484353857,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1794388966044,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Figure 5. Retrieve. The recall unit is the Event, not the 1-minute chunk, so a short line is not diluted inside a minute-long vector. Channels are fused, every candidate is\nre-read from MySQL at the task and content version that produced it, and only then reranked. ‖L∞‖ fusion is planned; today the weights adapt per query.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Figure 5. Retrieve. The recall unit is the Event, not the 1-minute chunk, so a short line is not diluted inside a minute-long vector. Channels are fused, every candidate is\nre-read from MySQL at the task and content version that produced it, and only then reranked. ‖L∞‖ fusion is planned; today the weights adapt per query.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.35
  },
